{"id":"4bb5d1f0ed4f","path":"/de/university/info/alumni/my-alumni/my-career-story","lang":"de","title":"Meine Karrieregeschichte","description":"Die USI Career Stories stellen die beruflichen Werdegänge von USI-Alumni vor, die im öffentlichen oder privaten Sektor in der Schweiz oder international tätig sind. Möchten Sie Ihre eigene Karrieregeschichte teilen?","section":"Universität","crumbs":["Universität","Info","Alumni","My Alumni"],"image":null,"words":116,"alternates":{"en":"/en/university/info/alumni/my-alumni/my-career-story","it":"/it/universita/info/alumni/my-alumni/la-mia-career-story","de":"/de/university/info/alumni/my-alumni/my-career-story"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Startseite","path":"/en"},{"label":"Universität","path":"/en/originalnode/8524"},{"label":"Info","path":"/en/originalnode/14049"},{"label":"Alumni","path":"/en/university/info/alumni"},{"label":"My Alumni","path":"/en/university/info/alumni/my-alumni"},{"label":"Meine Karrieregeschichte","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"html","html":"<p>Die USI Career Stories stellen die beruflichen Erfahrungen von USI Alumni (Absolventinnen und Absolventen) vor, die im öffentlichen oder privaten Sektor, im In- und Ausland, ins Berufsleben eingestiegen sind.</p> <p><em>Möchten Sie Ihre Career Story teilen?</em> Füllen Sie das <a href=\"https://form.arc.usi.ch/form/view.php?id=96237\">Career-Story-Formular</a> aus oder senden Sie uns ein <a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/alumni/alumni-usi-home-made-video-guidelines.2020.pdf\">kurzes Video</a>.</p> <p>Jede Woche werden die Erfahrungsberichte abwechselnd vorgestellt:</p> <ul> <li>auf der Website im <a href=\"/en/originalnode/574\">Alumni-Bereich</a></li> <li>auf der Website im <a href=\"/en/originalnode/661\">Karrierebereich</a></li> <li>in den sozialen Medien: Gruppen USI Alumni auf <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/groups/8250056/\">LinkedIn</a> &amp; <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/accounts/login/?next=/usialumniservice/\">Instagram</a></li> <li>im <a href=\"https://newsletter.usi.ch/ns_published/en/11\">Career Newsletter</a></li> <li>im <a href=\"https://newsletter.usi.ch/ns_published/en/1\">Newsletter USI Flash</a></li> </ul> <p><strong>Lesen Sie die bereits veröffentlichten <a href=\"/en/originalnode/663\">Career Stories</a></strong></p> <p>Zudem können Sie Ihre Career Story im Programm <a href=\"/en/originalnode/8977\"><strong>Visiting Alumni</strong></a> live erzählen:</p> <ul> <li>im <a href=\"/en/originalnode/15434\">Unterricht</a></li> <li>am <a href=\"/en/originalnode/14281\">Master Info Day</a></li> </ul> <p>Wenn Sie mitmachen möchten, kontaktieren Sie uns: <a href=\"mailto:alumni@usi.ch\">alumni@usi.ch</a></p>"}],"ctas":[],"nav":[{"label":"Alumni","href":"/en/university/info/alumni"},{"label":"Mein Alumni-Profil","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/my-alumni/profile"},{"label":"Meine Karrieregeschichte","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/my-alumni/my-career-story"},{"label":"Vorteile","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/my-alumni/benefits"},{"label":"Mein Chapter","href":"/en/originalnode/8951"},{"label":"Alumni-Kalender","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/events/alumni-calendar"},{"label":"Alumni Talks","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/meet-the-alumni/digital-talks"},{"label":"Visiting Alumni","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/meet-the-alumni/visiting-alumni"},{"label":"Chapter-Treffen","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/meet-the-alumni/chapter-meetings"},{"label":"Ehemaligentreffen","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/meet-the-alumni/reunions"},{"label":"Zahlen und Fakten","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/portraits/usi-graduates"},{"label":"USI Career Stories","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/portraits/career-stories"},{"label":"USI Alumni Mentors","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/portraits/usi-alumni-mentors"},{"label":"Absolvierendenbefragung","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/portraits/survey"},{"label":"Chapters","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/network/chapters"},{"label":"Executive Alumni","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/network/executive-alumni"},{"label":"Master-Gruppen","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/network/master-groups"},{"label":"AMA","href":"/en/universita/info/alumni/network/ama"},{"label":"Karrierekalender","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/events/career-calendar"},{"label":"Stellenangebote","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/careers/job-internship-offers"},{"label":"Karriereberatung","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/careers/career-counselling"},{"label":"Alumni-News","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/news/alumni-news"},{"label":"USI Alumni Award","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/usi-alumni-award"},{"label":"USI Alumni Newsletter","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/news/newsletter"},{"label":"Alumni Service Team","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/alumni-service"}],"links":[{"label":"Formular Career Story (PDF 638.34 KB)","href":"/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/alumni-form_career_story_it.pdf"},{"label":"Formular USI Career Story (en) (PDF 78.52 KB)","href":"/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/alumni-form_career_story_en.pdf"}],"source":"https://www.usi.ch/en/university/info/alumni/my-alumni/my-career-story","fetchedAt":"2026-10-08T17:43:52.584Z","translated":true}